  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy on Public Policy for Victims and Strengthening the Implementation of Planning Tools and the Development of Territorial Actions, for the Comprehensive Reparation of Victims in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the comprehensive reparation of victims of the armed conflict in Colombia, based on the advocacy on public policy for victims, strengthening the implementation of planning tools, and the development of territorial actions. For this, three effects are proposed:&#x2022; The first one aims for the Victims Unit (UARIV) to implement inter-institutional and intra-institutional adjustments to reduce the backlogs in the victims&apos; reparation processes.&#x2022; The second effect focuses on victims of the armed conflict in Colombia, increasing their participation and advocacy in decision-making for their comprehensive reparation in Bogot&#xe1;.&#x2022; The third effect will ensure that victims progress in the reparation processes through actions defined in planning tools (individual or collective reparation measures).</narrative>
  </description>
